{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56935","headline":"咏和凝范质（题拟） · 佚名","name":"咏和凝范质（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"从此庙堂添故事，登庸衣钵亦相传。\n（见《邵氏闻见录》卷七、《渑水燕谈录》卷六）（〖1〗《邵氏闻见录》云：「范鲁公质举进士，和凝爲主文，爱其文赋，凝自以第十三登第，谓鲁公曰：『君之文宜冠多士，屈居第十三者，欲君传老夫衣鉢耳。\n』鲁公以爲荣。\n至先後爲相。\n献诗者曰〖略〗。\n』」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56935.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56935","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}